OL,3,GNEWSAHourly chime artwork aims to
OL,4,Acelebrate city
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artwork which changes every hour
OL,7,Fwill be aiming to celebrate a city's
OL,8,Fidentity and bring back memories of its
OL,9,Fpast, the creators have said.
OL,11,FTimepiece will see different 50-second
OL,12,Flong collages made from archive film,
OL,13,Fphotos and audio chime on the hour
OL,14,Fthrough Sunderland's newly opened
OL,15,FCulture House from 16 November.
OL,17,FArtist Jeremy Bradfield said he hoped
OL,18,Fthe pieces, which would be accompanied
OL,19,Fby an original soundtrack from The
OL,20,FFutureheads' Ross Millard, would "stir"
OL,21,Fa lot of memories.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
